- identify tasks and know-how that rely on a single person, and make them transferable (procedures, guides, knowledge bases);
- connect the subsidiaries' data (ERP, accounting, banks, orders, inventory) and consolidate it at group level;
- design dashboards and alerts: cash, order book, production and delivery delays, margins, deadlines;
